  startButton: {fileID: 2074650266575491084}
  title: "COC 1 \u2014 Install and Configure Computer Systems"
  objectives:
  - 'Assemble the unit: mount the CPU, RAM, storage and power supply in the correct
    sockets.'
  - Bring the system to a bootable state and confirm it posts.
  - Install the operating system and complete first-time setup.
  - Configure the system to the job order and verify each setting.
  - Finish with no unresolved faults.
  rules: "Points are awarded per stage. Each mistake costs 10 points and every one
    is listed in your report. Finish with no mistakes at all for a 50-point bonus.
    Tutorial prompts are switched off for a graded run \u2014 you are being assessed
    on knowing the procedure, not on following instructions."
  bullet: "\u2022  "
